{"unit_id":"bf77f667191a3a0bafad","title":"提案七","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b4","raw_text":"提案七 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,154.15603637695312,92.0040054321289,170.1160430908203]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b5","raw_text":"案由：安眠藥及管制藥品用量審查原則, 提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":26,"bbox":[36.0,190.15603637695312,412.0,206.1160430908203]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b6","raw_text":"說明 : 1. 依據內科審查注意事項，15.鎮定劑及安眠藥使用多種或大劑量 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[36.0,226.15603637695312,563.9400024414062,242.1160430908203]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b7","raw_text":"          應加強審查。(100/1/1) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":27,"bbox":[36.0,262.1860046386719,291.9700012207031,278.14599609375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b8","raw_text":"       2. 安眠藥品/管制藥品之用量，不應超過仿單建議用量；病情有需 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[36.0,298.1860046386719,563.9400024414062,314.14599609375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b9","raw_text":"          要較高劑量時，可考慮會診精神科，並敘明理由(包括精神科)， \n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[36.0,334.1860046386719,567.4199829101562,350.14599609375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b10","raw_text":"          勿一次給予病人大量藥物。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":24,"bbox":[36.0,370.1860046386719,315.9700012207031,386.14599609375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b11","raw_text":"決議：通過，同說明段。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":13,"bbox":[36.0,406.1860046386719,219.9499969482422,422.14599609375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b12","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,442.2060241699219,43.97999954223633,458.166015625]}],"source_quality":[]}